            "sid": "ROM 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikugira ëno bhanga guitabhirria kömanya Ënooköë, Ënooköë aabhatiga kömaitegeerro gaabho amanyanku, korri iga bhakore amang'ana gano gataragërë iga bhakore. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bhaichöra ubhunyaanku bhui ichiteemo chonsui, öbhöbhëëbhë, öbhoyoku, na öbhötabhisia; bhaichöra irihari, ubhuiti, inkurenge, ököng'ainirria, öbhörëërëëma, ökörongohera abhandë, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "öbhögenki, bhano bharegërë Ënooköë, abhahöngö, abhaikumburi abhiheemi; bhano bhagöseemia gökora amanyanku, bhano bhatakuiguëra abhaibhuri bhaabho; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ichitöhö, bhano bhataana bhukumia, bhöhanchi gösë bhano bhataana bhuuya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbamanyërë iga imigiro gë Ënooköë nkögamba gërë iga abhantö bhano bhaagökora amang'ana gano ganga gayö nkëragërë iga bhakue. Tiiga iga nögökora ukuene hai, gëtatiga nguitabhirria bharë bhaara bhakögakora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.32"
            ]
          }
